        "expression": "let k = drift;\nlet back_layer = cloud(p * 1.4 * density + vec2<f32>(-t * 0.03 * k, 0.0));\nlet mid_layer = flow(p * 2.2 * density + vec2<f32>(0.0, t * 0.02 * k), t * 0.2 * k);\nlet front_layer = fbm(p * 3.2 * density + vec2<f32>(t * 0.06 * k, -t * 0.1 * k));\nlet wash = mix(c4, c2 * 0.6, smoothstep(0.25, 0.8, back_layer));\nlet ribbon = mix(c1, c3, smoothstep(0.3, 0.7, mid_layer));\nlet ribbon_mask = smoothstep(0.45, 0.7, mid_layer) * 0.9;\nlet bloom = smoothstep(0.5, 0.85, front_layer);\nlet blobs = c5 * bloom * 0.7 + c2 * smoothstep(0.55, 0.9, back_layer) * 0.3;\nlet color = wash + ribbon * ribbon_mask + blobs;\nreturn mix(bg, tonemap(color * 1.1), strength);",
        "name": "Drifting Ink Clouds",
